# Exercise demo generation

When creating or changing exercise how-to stills, loops, or the shared mannequin, **read and follow** `docs/exercise-demo-criteria.md` first.

- Same character, high camera, zoom crop, and black shorts as that file describes.
- Stills stay **unpainted** gray clay. Do not add lime muscle highlights.
- Save stills and loops under `content/exercises/` in this repo (see `content/exercises/README.md`). Copy loops into `app/src/main/assets/exercises/` when they should ship with the app.
- Do not invent a new look, camera, or file layout that contradicts the criteria.
